OL,3,GNEWSACracked wall forces closure of
OL,4,Acity's crown court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cracked wall has forced the closure
OL,7,Fof Nottingham Crown Court.
OL,9,FThe building on Canal Street was
OL,10,Fevacuated as a result on Wednesday, the
OL,11,FBBC understands.
OL,13,FA spokesperson for HM Courts and
OL,14,FTribunals Service (HMCTS) said the
OL,15,Fcracking was located at the entrance of
OL,16,Fthe building and some cases had been
OL,17,Fmoved to the Nottingham Magistrates'
OL,18,FCourt.
OL,20,FThey said the crown court was expected
OL,21,Fto fully reopen on Monday.
